---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
const title="Grave Seasons Release Date: March 9, 2027";
const description="Grave Seasons is planned for March 9, 2027 after its September 30 delay. Review the current launch status and gameplay preview.";
---
<Layout title={title} description={description} pageType="article" image="/images/grave-seasons-town-night.webp"><article class="container max-w-3xl py-10"><h1 class="text-4xl font-black text-bone">{title}</h1><p class="mt-4 text-fog">Grave Seasons has not been released. The developer moved the launch to March 9, 2027 in its September 30 announcement, and Steam currently shows the same date.</p><div class="prose-page mt-8">
<h2>What changed?</h2><p>The previous Fall 2026 window has been superseded. The team explains that console porting, optimization, controller improvements, and bug fixing need additional time. Older pages or artwork may still show the earlier window; they should not be used as the current launch plan.</p>
<h2>What does content complete mean?</h2><p>The team says it has stopped adding quests, items, and dialogue while final polish and bug fixing continue. Content complete does not mean the game is publicly playable, nor does it guarantee a bug-free launch.</p>
<h2>What should you prepare?</h2><p>Follow the current store listing for your platform and review purchase details when available. Our controller and crowbar preview explores the disclosed interface work and exploration design without inventing crop values, schedules, or a killer solution.</p>
<p><a href="/controller-and-crowbar-gameplay-preview/">Read the new gameplay preparation preview</a>.</p></div></article></Layout>